  "name": "Tracer mark at five stacks always explodes once with linear scaling (#7959)",
  "contract": [
    "Tracer Augmentation (653245) marks stack to five without Rocket Barrage. Every ranged hit refreshes the",
    "five-second window, so five Bomb Tosses must reach five marks with no explosion during the build. At the",
    "cap the duration stops refreshing and counts down, then the mark explodes exactly once and is gone.",
    "The engine multiplies the periodic tick by the stack count natively, so a one-mark baseline boom and the",
    "five-mark boom must stand in a 1:5 ratio: linear scaling, never squared."
  ],
